              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2 class=\u0022govuk-heading-m\u0022\u003ESetting card titles heading level and class\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe next example shows section cards with a custom heading level and class for all card titles. The example is set to use a heading value of \u003Cstrong\u003Eheading 3\u003C/strong\u003E and class\u0026nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003Egov-heading-s\u003C/strong\u003E for all the titles.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
